---
template_name: "device-manifest"
description: "Device detection output format and manifest generation"
category: "embedded"
variables:
  project_name: "my-project"
  devices: []
---
# Device Manifest: {{ project_name }}

## Detected Devices

```json
{
  "project": "{{ project_name }}",
  "timestamp": "{{ timestamp | default(now) }}",
  "devices": [
{% for device in devices %}
    {
      "port": "{{ device.port }}",
      "name": "{{ device.name }}",
      "type": "{{ device.type }}",
      "variant": "{{ device.variant }}",
      "vid": "{{ device.vid }}",
      "pid": "{{ device.pid }}",
      "serial": "{{ device.serial | default('') }}",
      "capabilities": {{ device.capabilities | default([]) | tojson }},
      "baud_rates": {{ device.baud_rates | default([115200]) | tojson }},
      "has_jtag": {{ device.has_jtag | default(false) | lower }}
    }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
  ]
}
```

## Device Summary

| Port | Device | Type | Serial |
|------|--------|------|--------|
{% for device in devices %}
| {{ device.port }} | {{ device.name }} | {{ device.type }}/{{ device.variant }} | {{ device.serial | default('N/A') }} |
{% endfor %}

## Configuration Mapping

```yaml
# Device assignments for {{ project_name }}
devices:
{% for device in devices %}
  - id: {{ device.name | snakecase }}
    port: {{ device.port }}
    profile: {{ device.type }}{% if device.variant %}_{{ device.variant }}{% endif %}
    baud_rate: {{ device.baud_rates[0] | default(115200) }}
{% if device.has_jtag %}
    jtag_enabled: true
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
```

## Deployment Script

```bash
#!/bin/bash
# Auto-generated deployment script for {{ project_name }}

PROJECT="{{ project_name }}"
{% for device in devices %}

# Deploy to {{ device.name }}
echo "Deploying to {{ device.name }} at {{ device.port }}..."
{% if device.type == "esp32" %}
esptool.py --port {{ device.port }} --baud {{ device.baud_rates[0] | default(921600) }} \
    write_flash 0x0 build/{{ device.type }}/firmware.bin
{% elif device.type == "arduino" %}
avrdude -p atmega328p -c arduino -P {{ device.port }} -b {{ device.baud_rates[0] | default(115200) }} \
    -U flash:w:build/arduino/firmware.hex:i
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

echo "Deployment complete!"
```
